## PART 1 — SETUP: CREATE YOUR DESIGN SYSTEM FIRST

> **This is the most important step. Do this before generating any screen.** If you skip this, every screen will look different.

### Step 1.1 — Open Stitch in Pro Mode

1. Go to <https://stitch.withgoogle.com>
2. Toggle **Experimental Mode** (top of the UI) → ON
3. Set layout: **Desktop** (1440px wide)
4. You are now using Gemini 2.5 Pro

### Step 1.2 — Generate the Design System (Run This Prompt First)

**Paste this entire prompt as your very first generation:**

```
Create a comprehensive design system for EduStream, a focused educational video platform.
EduStream is NOT YouTube. It is a distraction-free, curated learning platform used by
students, universities, and parents managing children's learning.

PRODUCT CONTEXT:
- Users save video links (YouTube, Vimeo) into curated collections
- Videos play inside EduStream, not on YouTube (no recommendations, no ads)
- Key user types: individual learners, org/university admins, parents (kids mode)
- Competitors in feel: Linear.app, Notion, Coursera — NOT YouTube, Netflix

DESIGN SYSTEM SPECIFICATION:

COLOR PALETTE:
- Sidebar background: #0F172A (slate-950, very dark navy)
- Main background: #F8FAFC (slate-50, off-white — not pure white)
- Card background: #FFFFFF with border: 1px solid #E2E8F0
- Primary accent: #6366F1 (indigo-500) — used for active states, CTAs, links
- Primary accent hover: #4F46E5 (indigo-600)
- Primary accent light (for icon backgrounds): #EEF2FF (indigo-50)
- Success green: #22C55E
- Warning amber: #F59E0B
- Danger red: #EF4444
- Text primary: #1E293B (slate-800)
- Text secondary: #64748B (slate-500)
- Text muted: #94A3B8 (slate-400)
- Sidebar text (default): #94A3B8
- Sidebar text (active): #FFFFFF
- Sidebar active bg: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15) with left border 3px solid #6366F1
- Divider: #1E293B (very subtle in sidebar), #E2E8F0 in main area

TYPOGRAPHY:
- Font family: Inter (all weights)
- Display heading: 28px, weight 700, color #1E293B
- Page heading: 22px, weight 600, color #1E293B
- Section heading: 16px, weight 600, color #1E293B
- Body text: 14px, weight 400, color #1E293B
- Secondary text: 13px, weight 400, color #64748B
- Caption/label: 12px, weight 500, color #94A3B8 (uppercase for labels)
- Code/numbers: 'JetBrains Mono' or monospace

SPACING SYSTEM:
- Base unit: 4px
- Card padding: 20px
- Section gap: 32px
- Sidebar item padding: 10px 16px
- Content max-width: 1200px centered in main area

COMPONENT SPECS:

Sidebar (240px wide, full height, fixed):
- Background: #0F172A
- Top: 24px left padding, "EduStream" logo text in white, weight 700, 18px
- Nav items: icon (20px, colored per item) + label (14px) + optional badge
