Video Card (standard):
- Border-radius: 12px
- Thumbnail: 16:9 ratio, border-radius top 12px, with duration chip (bottom-right)
- Duration chip: dark semi-transparent bg (#000000cc), 11px white monospace text, rounded-full
- Title: 14px, weight 600, 2-line clamp, color #1E293B
- Channel name: 12px, color #64748B
- Progress bar: 3px height, #6366F1 color, gray track, shown below thumbnail if in progress
- Hover: translateY(-2px) + shadow elevation

Collection Card:
- Thumbnail grid (2x2 collage of video thumbnails, or single image)
- Collection title, video count badge, visibility badge (Public/Private/Unlisted)
- "View Collection" hover overlay

Stat Card:
- White background, border, border-radius 12px
- Icon in colored circle (indigo-50 bg, indigo icon)
- Large number (32px, weight 700)
- Label below (13px, #64748B)
- Optional: small trend indicator (+12% green arrow)

Button variants:
- Primary: bg #6366F1, text white, border-radius 8px, height 36px, hover bg #4F46E5
- Secondary: bg white, border 1px solid #E2E8F0, text #1E293B, hover bg #F8FAFC
