Input/Search bar:
- Height: 40px, border: 1px solid #E2E8F0, border-radius 8px
- Focus: border-color #6366F1, ring: 3px rgba(99,102,241,0.15)
- Left icon slot, right clear button

Badge variants:
- Public: green bg (#DCFCE7), green text (#16A34A)
- Private: gray bg (#F1F5F9), gray text (#475569)
- Unlisted: amber bg (#FEF9C3), amber text (#A16207)
- Premium: indigo bg (#EEF2FF), indigo text (#4F46E5)
- Free: gray bg (#F1F5F9), gray text (#64748B)

LAYOUT STRUCTURE:
Fixed left sidebar (240px) + scrollable main content area (flex-1).
Main content: 32px top/bottom padding, 40px left/right padding, max-width 1200px.

Show me the complete design system as a design reference sheet with all components
displayed together: color swatches, typography scale, all button variants, card examples,
badge examples, sidebar anatomy, and the overall layout grid. Use real content (not lorem ipsum).
```

**After generating:** Click "Export DESIGN.md" and save this file. This is your brand bible — you will paste it into every future Stitch session.

