## PART 2 — THE PROMPT FRAMEWORK (Read Before Every Prompt)

Use the **Zoom-Out-Zoom-In** framework for every screen prompt:

```
[ZOOM OUT — Product & User Context]
Who is using this screen, what is their goal, what emotional state are they in?

[DESIGN SYSTEM]
Paste your DESIGN.md content here (or reference the colors/specs above)

[ZOOM IN — This Specific Screen]
Exact screen name, exact components needed, exact data to show, exact states

[CONSTRAINTS]
What NOT to include. What this screen must NOT look like.
```

