## PART 3 — SCREEN-BY-SCREEN PROMPTS

### ⚡ IMPORTANT BEFORE EACH PROMPT:
1. Start a **new canvas** per screen (don't stack screens on one canvas)
2. Use **Pro mode** for every first generation
3. After first generation, use "Add variant" (not new generation) for tweaks
4. Generate **2 variants** for complex screens, pick the better one
5. After each screen: click **"Paste to Figma"** to build your Figma file in parallel

