- Share/Import Flow
- Error states, empty states, loading states
- Color variants of cards
- Any refinement/tweaks of above Pro screens

### Tips to Maximize Generation Quality

**Before hitting Generate:**
1. Always paste your DESIGN.md first (ensures color/font consistency)
2. Be specific about screen dimensions ("Desktop, 1440px")
3. Give real data, not lorem ipsum (Stitch generates better with real content)
4. Specify what NOT to include (constraints section) — Stitch will default to Material Design 3 which may not match your vision
5. For complex screens, describe sections in top-to-bottom order

**After generating:**
1. If a section looks wrong, use "Edit this section" chat follow-up (don't regenerate the whole screen)
2. Try "Make the sidebar darker and more minimal" as a refinement prompt
3. Generate 2 variants for the Dashboard and Watch page, pick the better one

