## PART 7 — DESIGN DECISIONS & CONSTRAINTS SUMMARY

| Decision | What to Do | What NOT to Do |
|---|---|---|
| Primary color | Indigo (#6366F1) throughout | Do NOT use red (YouTube), blue-500 (generic) |
| Sidebar | Always dark (#0F172A) | Do NOT make sidebar light or auto-collapse |
| Background | #F8FAFC (off-white) | Do NOT use pure white (#FFF) for main bg |
| Cards | White bg + subtle border + radius 12px | Do NOT use gray cards on gray bg |
| Video progress | Always visible as thin bar on thumbnail | Do NOT hide progress behind hover |
| Typography | Inter everywhere (adults), Nunito (kids) | Do NOT mix font families |
| Recommendations | Restrained, section-based | Do NOT make it feel like infinite feed |
| Kids Mode | Completely separate color system | Do NOT use adult design with "kid colors" sprinkled in |
| Buttons | Icon + label (never icon-only for primary) | Do NOT hide primary actions |
| Empty states | Custom illustration + specific message | Do NOT use generic "No data" text |

